# A copy of kybernesis's standard architecture (foundations/kybernesis/architectures/standard.arch) at its founding, 2026-11-18,
# kept as the visualization layer's fixture: the layer reads architecture scripts and depends on no foundation for them.
# The standard architecture of kybernesis: the loop from evidence to action (ADR 0130; decision 0002).
#
# An architecture is data. It declares the registers and the stages of one turn, the kinds of fact, the types that travel on
# wires, the blocks with their ports and laws, the boundaries through which the loop is given what it does not make, and the
# wires. A revision is another script; it is admitted when its checks pass (architecture/checks.hpp).

architecture standard version 1

# The registers, in the order of aboutness: what is manifested is relational, and what is relational concerns what obtains.
registers Manifestational < Relational < Ontological

# The stages of one turn, earliest first, and the register of each.
stages before < observed < recorded < after
stage before in Ontological
stage observed in Manifestational
stage recorded in Relational
stage after in Ontological

# The kinds of fact, each under the kind it is a kind of; a register is inherited unless stated.
kind Fact in Ontological
kind Condition under Fact
kind Occurrence under Fact
kind Trace under Fact in Manifestational
kind Relational under Fact in Relational
kind Social under Relational
kind Proposal under Social
kind Institutional under Social
kind Uptake under Institutional
kind Decision under Institutional
kind Normative under Institutional
kind Policy under Normative
kind Standard under Normative
kind Rule under Normative
kind Finding under Relational
kind Construal under Finding
kind Estimate under Finding
kind Evaluation under Finding

# Examples, declared with their operators: kinds of evaluation that no block yields.
example Feature under Evaluation
example Need under Evaluation
example Problem under Evaluation
example Risk under Evaluation
example Asset under Evaluation

# The types that travel on wires, each in a register.
type State in Ontological
type Traces in Manifestational
type Words in Manifestational
type Terms in Relational
type Operators in Relational
type Standards in Relational
type Rules in Relational
type Proposals in Relational
type Practice in Relational
type Readings in Relational
type Belief in Relational
type Evaluations in Relational
type PolicyVersion in Relational
type Action in Relational
type Inquiry in Relational

# What enters from outside the loop.
boundary Constitution yields Rule at recorded {
  out terms : Terms
  out operators : Operators
  out standards : Standards
  out rules : Rules
}
boundary Proposals yields Proposal at recorded {
  out proposals : Proposals
}
boundary Practice yields Policy at recorded {
  out practice : Practice
}

# The blocks.
block System yields Condition at before laws referred {
  in state : State
  out state : State
}
block Collection yields Trace at observed laws total {
  in state : State
  in inquiry : Inquiry
  out traces : Traces
}
block Evidence yields Trace at observed laws total {
  in traces : Traces
  out traces : Traces
  out words : Words
}
block Interpretation yields Construal at recorded laws total {
  in words : Words
  in terms : Terms
  out readings : Readings
}
block Estimation yields Estimate at recorded laws total, sound {
  in traces : Traces
  in readings : Readings
  in prior : Belief
  in action : Action
  out belief : Belief
}
block Evaluation yields Evaluation at recorded laws total, deterministic {
  in belief : Belief
  in readings : Readings
  in operators : Operators
  in standards : Standards
  out evaluations : Evaluations
}
block PolicyMaking yields Policy at recorded laws total {
  in evaluations : Evaluations
  in belief : Belief
  in proposals : Proposals
  in practice : Practice
  in rules : Rules
  in current : PolicyVersion
  out policy : PolicyVersion
}
block Policy yields Policy at recorded laws total {
  in policy : PolicyVersion
  in belief : Belief
  out action : Action
  out current : PolicyVersion
}
block Decision yields Decision at recorded laws total {
  in action : Action
  out intervention : Action
  out inquiry : Inquiry
}
block Realisation yields Occurrence at after laws referred {
  in state : State
  in action : Action
  out state : State
}

# The wires; "next" carries a value to the next turn.
wire System.state -> Collection.state
wire System.state -> Realisation.state
wire Collection.traces -> Evidence.traces
wire Evidence.traces -> Estimation.traces
wire Evidence.words -> Interpretation.words
wire Constitution.terms -> Interpretation.terms
wire Interpretation.readings -> Estimation.readings
wire Interpretation.readings -> Evaluation.readings
wire Estimation.belief -> Evaluation.belief
wire Estimation.belief -> Policy.belief
wire Estimation.belief -> PolicyMaking.belief
wire Estimation.belief -> Estimation.prior next
wire Constitution.operators -> Evaluation.operators
wire Constitution.standards -> Evaluation.standards
wire Constitution.rules -> PolicyMaking.rules
wire Evaluation.evaluations -> PolicyMaking.evaluations
wire Proposals.proposals -> PolicyMaking.proposals
wire Practice.practice -> PolicyMaking.practice
wire PolicyMaking.policy -> Policy.policy
wire Policy.current -> PolicyMaking.current next
wire Policy.action -> Decision.action
wire Decision.intervention -> Realisation.action
wire Decision.intervention -> Estimation.action next
wire Decision.inquiry -> Collection.inquiry next
wire Realisation.state -> System.state next
